@baseUrl = http://localhost:8089
@candidateId = 1

### 후보 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/adm/candidates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "김후보",
  "description": "기호 1번 후보",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/candidates/1.png"
}

### 후보 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/adm/candidates/{{candidateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "김후보 수정",
  "description": "기호 1번 후보 소개 수정",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/candidates/1-updated.png"
}

### 후보 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/adm/candidates/{{candidateId}}
